{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4652afc7771a38572f46a20db16bb1f423d0a71cb02b7c81636a32b51504f158",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d8ad83f6f14ff0500887cebf408c5501f576e595c2cc53a486af2c57f6ba031",
      "text": "独一无二的生日会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:414676055bb70528a531c4b97648cd83c24097badb1b14b77951cc6c7ad14d54",
      "text": "课程结束后，诚司递给英雄、龙和制作人一个信封。那是天音为诚司准备的生日会邀请函。信上写着天音充满爱意的“要求”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d8ad83f6f14ff0500887cebf408c5501f576e595c2cc53a486af2c57f6ba031",
      "text": "独一无二的生日会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fdf9ae63f32104ba2e793ecaa75471f63f213f71b03b68cbb48c7260c36ea8f",
      "text": "各位，今天的课程也辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:488bf00576a131e59bbd7982ac4d8fde7c75a22858b7dc04877a1ef4c4b288f2",
      "text": "辛苦了，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c48219202902bb3bf07787d107ea54ea2a052384b96f916bfed8437eb5ebb471",
      "text": "今天这就结束了吧。那么，\n大家辛苦啦！明天也请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c145d893fc738d6358d86c517fafd939419f17d412106c323050df84defd9451",
      "text": "龙，稍等一下。还有英雄和\n制作人也是，可以耽误一下吗？我有话想跟你们说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8130230addf206adee159bcad67e56e2863be173ac3109ed5adec8d38606c19",
      "text": "可以是可以，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97c0816b433173f246a17e40c5f4ad665837bde6bdd02c176c22d46e2bb542a3",
      "text": "谢谢。\n其实我想把这个给你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c04ca992dea478165f1f6644c9209891bdbb273f9e7288324588144bb6369d43",
      "text": "相当可爱的信封呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e5eaa2928e398fe809fe2ecef5b9182f8bd339b3df13df001a5215eb2631761",
      "text": "确实，跟诚司先生平时的形象很不搭呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:169800b5de3d9b116e31b02439bcd6cfe394afcaac09a041a92cc48874abba3b",
      "text": "因为这是天音给各位的邀请函啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2ff4baf01f1ee69a2cb4b754ad2ea12711cdc3e176ababd97edc4c57bba0342",
      "text": "听说今年由天音主办，\n要为我举办一场生日派对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5011586d84d889aa9613b1725c7ab1779621cacd47bf3c4fcf621df69d6f9021",
      "text": "这样啊！太好了呢，诚司先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ab097f87baf194ab644716099446b8655f386b205552e80e952929566a24c54",
      "text": "嗯。她从前一阵子就开始计划了。\n还干劲满满地说今年要做蛋糕呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2248b3ab2acd48d3dcb7f6be43afe49dc3377f198d611eb8ff128671c884a1ad",
      "text": "那封邀请函也是纯手工制作的哦。\n她说自己非常努力才做好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3ceed720d2bcfd4d0fd6b9da51aaff66f77c0262e6ebe67f468cae15f42073e",
      "text": "那么，我们赶快读读看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6799b217e6fcc30210260454888b445cd03ad020e5ba690fe604ffd98a55cd89",
      "text": "哎，等等。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd4c675a78a290e053e067a42347aa11304812d6cd485b0a96d62199ad009f26",
      "text": "天音千叮咛万嘱咐，\n说绝对不能让我看到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bfaa408da8022ed510339f038b46ba9fb8fa93eddc28dfeacf547e03b075bf9",
      "text": "等我看不到之后，你们再看邀请函吧。\n那我先告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:269dad7d97b68fa3fde639a9431f681fd99cd09d943509f0e6b65f39ab4ff7a9",
      "text": "好！\n诚司先生辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02e0fdc171c0dd0b11d9a6cb43dcb3703b032afb1aa7cee6b35666e3ba53b9a7",
      "text": "辛苦了，下次工作见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:919789812201459dd0c6009dbcaeeb0b0dc1e4b69a35f0b2349087404a372139",
      "text": "好，差不多可以了。来读邀请函吧。\n……这真是力作啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:740a9428ca00daae06ba47f1c0226db294df5c540162a47c455b440891726a79",
      "text": "是的呢。举办地点是诚司先生家，\n时间写着是在诚司先生生日的前几天呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8faea72e31971ffbae2d83626b8da95fe2ca537fbbd91e3c156f5e91e3a25f02",
      "text": "这样啊——\n诚司先生生日当天排了工作嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4ad55f10c18395ce536e79ab226e84bfc218261d40096e16b6f1c0820e43c7d",
      "text": "要带的东西是……送给诚司先生的礼物，\n还有生日会的装饰品吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e35c8cb0b35192c84aa0210be2d7e6bee2eb87ef88f72ca3ae21c908734b2e84",
      "text": "信上也写了信玄提过的蛋糕的事呢。\n还说“敬请期待”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0879a7c85589b58cb8b535b31fd9392a8731b9d98eff6de3aaf095813dc4c683",
      "text": "说起来，之前诚司先生问过我这几天的日程安排呢——原来是为了这个啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0507d1ac8b9be6befe31811a3cb2dd3407c0317750fe618c20dcb5cb548dc910",
      "text": "我也被问了。大概是受天音酱所托吧。\n制作人也被问过了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a5fd9e15607b4a3b55f60fef05fcea2a78883472753237956a9c80ae480efd0",
      "text": "是的。这一天我已经空出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31bd57c9caaf9d265a11c9c4a0e7d89df378068a3b06770b5a901dc97b6d1e5c",
      "text": "那在场的各位都要参加呢。\n各自去回复一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000023:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:876bb973ef8128918c61be73e1d03c60c521d67286bc251152b77ad9fb0f84cc",
      "text": "生日会当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af46ad2536de039a24d8af9d666f83d1a8b95827739ba2ebfc090f3a1299b37",
      "text": "欢迎大家过来。\n现在天音正在做蛋糕的最后收尾工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5a328d8373d43d63e51f88490f06020b69a21562be9a7b89c4a209d321490de",
      "text": "她正在集中精神，好像不想让人跟她搭话。\n不好意思，能再稍微等一会儿吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:434e6f9b7921ff6f25c190487cd36e12d943d836a678e1cd912fb04853905238",
      "text": "明白了。那我们\n趁这会儿把拜托我们布置的房间装饰起来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a161e342b7c4f6c5c5c022a8467d04b754d2e27c7c479e45e4f085ad1a51bd85",
      "text": "好的！真期待天音小姐做的蛋糕呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6c26c32f1124304f64f50ee2441eaa4fe40b941cdf6a85fac80e7b48298fef9",
      "text": "要在蛋糕边缘挤鲜奶油是吧。\n知道了。这样弄如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:639fea682b2704ec114f512f956686f62819d3c31dd5d3f357511cd6a8c3e1e9",
      "text": "接下来摆上水果是吧。\n……噢，太厉害了，看起来很好吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1f57092e628154a775ef571aeb25da484ccdf63146ccf0ce4b7450412fd3f9e",
      "text": "厨房里传来了很开心的声音呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a7a49b88a1f7f2d391bccc06c42b49c9200c9bbf3cfb1c605154f7eb19a2099",
      "text": "趁他们两个努力的时候，我们这边也搞定吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:648d8895187d9847a97f55b24a39365d54c209754d0b5f56f222466e9be433ab",
      "text": "好的！那我来装饰那边吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9190448181bcfcda4b7ecde81a6948b414942cd058b2980a5ba66e5775b2e8bc",
      "text": "好，装饰完成！诚司先生、天音酱，\n我们这边准备好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:498bebb8f76b17bc311cdbb26282fda490a605c01007cc93a7e5ce02d4847472",
      "text": "噢噢，这是……感觉都不像自己的房间了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_d:cmd-000196:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:739c7ef204c4034c51e8cc03693a9cf1fb3d8b8d65a2f59d379f8ea31dfe9d0e",
      "text": "谢谢你们。这边蛋糕也刚刚做好了。\n这就和天音一起端过来。稍等一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b6dfc9072d8bde2b82fdee10ca68a1248f22afbbf7874561a1fe455a45608e2",
      "text": "再次祝诚司先生生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f3656f2f5d58076b6b157d262d96bacd54273ab5303318dada44a7e55ca9db7",
      "text": "生日快乐，信玄。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80339777f70f87fc305b55ae7442159dbe2ed6f89d9d61c7326fc8a3e3a73b17",
      "text": "诚司先生，祝您生日快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bda4863a6e152d3c3c068ef838f73e77e4f15c98afe2bd29e030ae99e6797eb",
      "text": "感谢各位今天来参加我的生日会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dd01fa0f5c39999a3c42c8ff5d7a5cb53d0badb220117289828a476a81e00b3",
      "text": "天音也是，谢谢你准备了邀请函和蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c42e7998adac10184694de1a10f71503b98f045ff8c40b1912ad562836102e0",
      "text": "那么赶快把蜡烛吹……啊，等等，\n天音之前交代过一件事来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:050d0e5d2d79d21b9cd6d687f125c8a31c3b7d86b46e366d690ac30147c0af48",
      "text": "说是吹灭蜡烛前要先许愿，\n对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff2f248aa0ec5a16c1d414e57cf704ae6f216ff32bd05026e33622011824609d",
      "text": "……希望明年也能像这样，\n和大家一起庆祝生日。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_e:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2ff178b852f529d70547b787099571dfc9ca8d982e35e99193de804219edca0",
      "text": "生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
